{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Mortgage iCalculator 是一款專注於按揭計算的財務工具，適合準備置業、比較融資方案或評估收租物業的人士。它讓你在無需自行建立試算表的情況下，快速掌握不同情境下的供款與現金流數字。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>按揭供款與收租回報計算</h2>\n<p>輸入貸款金額、利率與年期，即可快速估算每月供款，瞭解不同融資選擇如何影響置業成本。程式亦可把多個貸款方案並列比較，調整利率與年期等假設後即時看到結果變化。若打算買樓收租，更可進一步估算租金收入、支出與現金流，協助判斷物業是否值得投資。計算結果僅供參考，並非財務、借貸或投資建議。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-179-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-180-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-181-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-182-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-183-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Mortgage iCalculator</li>\n<li>應用類別：Finance</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-24T03:59:40.633689+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":323,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}